{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_1","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"大哉，聖祖之建業也！後嗣承序，以廣親親。至于孝武，以諸侯王疆土過制，或替差失軌，而子弟為匹夫，〔一〕輕重不相準，於是制詔御史：「諸侯王或欲推私恩分子弟邑者，令各條上，朕且臨定其號名。」自是支庶畢侯矣。詩云「文王孫子，本支百世」，〔二〕信矣哉！〔三〕","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_2","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"〔一〕　師古曰：「疆亦壃字也。替，古僣字也。軌，法也。」","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_3","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"〔二〕　師古曰：「大雅文王之詩也。本，本宗也。支，支子也。言文王有明德，故天祚子，子孫嫡者為天子，支庶為諸侯，皆不絕也。」","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_4","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"〔三〕　師古曰：「侯所食邑，皆書其郡縣於下。其有不書者，史失之也。或但言某人嗣及直書薨，不具年月，皆闕文也。」","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_5","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"王子侯表第三上","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_6","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"校勘記","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_7","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四二八頁　三欄　三格，錢大昭說「一百二十」當作「一百二十七」。　王先謙說史表正作「一百二十七」。「十年」，景祐、殿本都作「七年八月」。　四格「三」，景祐、殿本都作「二」。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_8","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四三０頁　四欄　四格，錢大昭說「二年」當作「三年」。　王先謙說史表作「三年」。　按景祐本正作「三年」。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_9","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四三一頁　三欄　四格，景祐、殿本「耐」作「削」。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_10","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四三二頁　一欄　三格「齊」，景祐、殿、局本都作「濟」。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_11","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四三三頁　三欄　一格「艮」，景祐、殿本都作「良」。　王先謙說「艮」字誤。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_12","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四三四頁　一欄　四格，景祐本作「削」，殿本作「耐」。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_13","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四三六頁　二欄　三格，王先謙說「己」當為「乙」。　按景祐、殿本正作「乙」。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_14","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四三七頁　三欄　一格「楊」，景祐、殿本都作「陽」。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_15","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四三九頁　二欄　三格，王先謙說「九」當為「五」。　按景祐、殿、局本都作「五」。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_16","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四四０頁　二欄　五格「恭」，景祐、殿、局本都作「莽」。　王先謙說作「莽」是。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_17","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四四一頁　二欄　四格「二十」，景祐本作「三十」。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_18","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四四一頁　四欄　三格「五年」，景祐、殿、局本都作「五月」。　王先謙說作「五月」是。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_19","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四四三頁　二欄　二格「弟」，殿、局本都作「子」。　王先謙說作「子」是，史表同。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_20","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四五０頁　四欄　四格「容」，王先謙說閩本、汪本都作「客」，史表同。　按景祐本作「客」。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_21","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四五一頁　一欄　三格，王先謙說「十年」當作「十月」。　按景祐本作「十月」。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_22","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四五一頁　五欄　一格，殿本作「曜」，景祐本誤作「曜」。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_23","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四五三頁　二欄　三格「新」，殿、局本都作「薪」。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_24","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四五三頁　三欄　三格原在四格，據景祐、殿、局本提上。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_25","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四五四頁　四欄　三格「五月」，景祐、殿本都作「正月」。　王先謙說作「正月」是。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_26","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四六六頁　一欄　四格，王念孫說「三」字誤，景祐本作「二十五年」。　五格「一十九年」，景祐、殿本「一」作「二」。　王先謙說作「二」是。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_27","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四六六頁　二欄　四、五格原在三、四格，據景祐、殿本改。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_28","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四六七頁　四欄　三格，王先謙說汪本「二」作「三」、「三」作「二」，是。　按景祐、殿本同。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_29","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四六七頁　五欄　七格「子」，景祐、殿本都作「予」。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_30","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四六八頁　一欄　三格「二月」，景祐、殿本都作「三月」。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_31","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四六八頁　二欄　三格「二月」，景祐、殿本都作「三月」。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_32","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四六九頁　二欄　七格「社」，景祐、殿、局本都作「祉」。　朱一新說作「祉」是。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_33","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四六九頁　三欄　三格「八月」，景祐、殿、局本都作「八年」。　王先謙說作「八年」是。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_34","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四七四頁　四欄　一格「于」，景祐、殿本都作「丁」。　五格「永」，景祐、殿本都作「元」。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_35","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四七五頁　三欄　三格「十兩」，景祐、殿、局本都作「八兩」。　四格，錢大昭說「始元」當作「元始」。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_han_thu_16_36","chapterId":"ch_work_han_thu_16","textTraditional":"四七九頁　四欄　一格，王先謙說「成」當作「城」。　按景祐、殿本都作「城」。","sentenceOrder":36}],"overrides":{}}